Results of an intercepts-only model are somewhat unhappy, as it
apparently can’t separately estimate phi and det:

test1 <- gmultmix(~1, ~1, ~1,data=umfGMM,mixture="P")
test1

Call:
gmultmix(lambdaformula = ~1, phiformula = ~1, pformula = ~1,
    data = umfGMM, mixture = "P")

Abundance:
